** Probe: ARCFTOPT with an airport ID and ARCFTSRC naming a VOLUME source
** that has an HOUREMIS file with the sixteen-field aircraft record
** (aermod.f AHRQREAD). Setup pass only; the hourly file is 25b_hourly.dat.
** AERMOD said: accepted. The first guess put ARCFTSRC on a POINT source:
** SO E833, the source does not fall into the aircraft category (VOLUME
** and AREA only).
CO STARTING
   TITLEONE  oracle 25b: ARCFTOPT airport and ARCFTSRC on a VOLUME source with an aircraft HOUREMIS record
   MODELOPT  CONC  FLAT  ALPHA
   AVERTIME  1  24
   POLLUTID  SO2
   ARCFTOPT  KLAX
   RUNORNOT  NOT
   ERRORFIL  25b.err
CO FINISHED

SO STARTING
   LOCATION  VOL1  VOLUME  0.0  0.0  0.0
   SRCPARAM  VOL1  1.0  5.0  10.0  5.0
   HOUREMIS  25b_hourly.dat  VOL1
   ARCFTSRC  VOL1
   SRCGROUP  ALL
SO FINISHED

RE STARTING
   DISCCART  500.  500.  0.
RE FINISHED

ME STARTING
   SURFFILE  AERMET2.SFC
   PROFFILE  AERMET2.PFL
   SURFDATA  14735  1988  ALBANY,NY
   UAIRDATA  14735  1988  ALBANY,NY
   PROFBASE  0.0  METERS
ME FINISHED

OU STARTING
   RECTABLE  ALLAVE  FIRST
OU FINISHED
